    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>You\u2019ve fallen through reality into a place that shouldn\u2019t exist\u2014a world that defies logic and reason.</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Explore!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore your new home\u2014endless rooms that stretch into oblivion. With every step you take, you may draw closer to escape... or to your doom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408610/extras/4efaabf6b6dd0a58f1f4a0334ef930c5.poster.avif?t=1737457884\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408610/extras/4efaabf6b6dd0a58f1f4a0334ef930c5.webm?t=1737457884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408610/extras/4efaabf6b6dd0a58f1f4a0334ef930c5.mp4?t=1737457884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Puzzles!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles as you navigate the strange and unsettling world you\u2019ve fallen into.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408610/extras/27653242c805dbe3ac906079f7c97c7d.poster.avif?t=1737457884\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408610/extras/27653242c805dbe3ac906079f7c97c7d.webm?t=1737457884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408610/extras/27653242c805dbe3ac906079f7c97c7d.mp4?t=1737457884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Survive or Relax!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the creatures that call this place home, or choose to sit back, relax, and enjoy a coffee as you embrace this strange new world as your vacation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose between entity free gameplay or not!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408610/extras/54d8ee505a9d781de59a54ec18d233b9.poster.avif?t=1737457884\" width=800 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408610/extras/54d8ee505a9d781de59a54ec18d233b9.webm?t=1737457884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408610/extras/54d8ee505a9d781de59a54ec18d233b9.mp4?t=1737457884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br> <br><u></u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>You\u2019ve fallen through reality into a place that shouldn\u2019t exist\u2014a world that defies logic and reason.</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Explore!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore your new home\u2014endless rooms that stretch into oblivion. With every step you take, you may draw closer to escape... or to your doom.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408610/extras/4efaabf6b6dd0a58f1f4a0334ef930c5.poster.avif?t=1737457884\" width=800 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408610/extras/4efaabf6b6dd0a58f1f4a0334ef930c5.webm?t=1737457884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408610/extras/4efaabf6b6dd0a58f1f4a0334ef930c5.mp4?t=1737457884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Puzzles!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles as you navigate the strange and unsettling world you\u2019ve fallen into.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408610/extras/27653242c805dbe3ac906079f7c97c7d.poster.avif?t=1737457884\" width=800 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408610/extras/27653242c805dbe3ac906079f7c97c7d.webm?t=1737457884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408610/extras/27653242c805dbe3ac906079f7c97c7d.mp4?t=1737457884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Survive or Relax!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive the creatures that call this place home, or choose to sit back, relax, and enjoy a coffee as you embrace this strange new world as your vacation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose between entity free gameplay or not!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408610/extras/54d8ee505a9d781de59a54ec18d233b9.poster.avif?t=1737457884\" width=800 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408610/extras/54d8ee505a9d781de59a54ec18d233b9.webm?t=1737457884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408610/extras/54d8ee505a9d781de59a54ec18d233b9.mp4?t=1737457884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br> <br><u></u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "The Transitions is a psychological horror game set in the eerie Backrooms universe. Explore unsettling liminal spaces, solve mind-bending puzzles, and evade the horrors lurking within. As you delve deeper, reality begins to blur\u2014will you escape, or lose yourself forever?",
